{"kind":"request","text":"Read-only R5 remainder review found two operator/protocol choices before implementation. New bearer digests can atomically carry issued/expiry timestamps (30 days); valid fresh bearer control rotates/renews, expired requests return 401, and replay never extends expiry. Persisted plaintext must be removed from all three copies: agent.answer, agent.control.answer and registry.control.answer. Only the fresh terminal-operation winner returns the raw bearer; replay uses a secret-free already-shown receipt. Lost first response requires a new signed bearer operation, preserving enrolment/retry custody.\n\n1. Legacy active tokens have no reliable issuance timestamp: agent.updated also changes on config writes. Recommend requiring explicit signed renewal at cutover; alternative is one fixed, persisted operator-chosen grace deadline, never rolling now+30days on activation. Please choose.\n2. Recommend closing already-open hosted streams at bearer expiry using the existing HTTP lifecycle, with bounded timer rechecks rather than a 30-day timer or new Durable Object alarm. New calls after expiry refuse; calls admitted before expiry may finish under their original operation fences. Please confirm or specify request-only expiry.\n\nWire proposal: keep original 201/200 status and stable agent/key/member/by metadata on retained replay, with bearerShown:true and bearerExpires, no bearer. After existing retention, keep stale 409. All current plaintext and reset-replay assertions need corresponding native witnesses and bounded legacy stored-answer redaction. R15 retirement remains separate. Current slice A continues independently; no existing token or stream was modified.","body":{"conditions":"Choose the legacy active-bearer cutover and existing-stream expiry behavior for R5 items 4–5. Builder may implement routine new-token 30-day expiry and secret-free once-only receipts after the bounded design is tracked; this question does not authorize deployment or arbitrary existing credential resets.","no_git_artifact":"true","to":"20db43a245e9780b92a587425d387d393b17ffc90b89e036ff752399f88fc517"}}